Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 20 18:55:00 2026 +1000

    Wait for fluentd to tail late log files.

    check-logs.sh fails a job when a log file under /var/log/kolla has no
    "following tail of" line in fluentd.log, but never waits for one.
    in_tail only finds new files every refresh_interval, 60 seconds by
    default, so a service logging just before the check looks missing.

    Retry for three refresh intervals before failing. This only sleeps
    when there is a gap, so a healthy job is unaffected.

    Prompt: Michael asked why change 976889 was given a Verified-1 by an
    unrelated check-logs.sh failure, and then for a fix.

    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context, high effort) <noreply@anthropic.com>

    Change-Id: I1e250d2128e360c4022870bf05c282661d879c84
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

diff --git a/tests/check-logs.sh b/tests/check-logs.sh
index 454fbf8..a098e38 100755
--- a/tests/check-logs.sh
+++ b/tests/check-logs.sh
@@ -211,12 +211,22 @@ if sudo test -d /var/log/kolla; then
         fi
     done
 
-    if check_fluentd_missing_logs >/dev/null; then
-        any_critical=1
-        echo "(critical) Found some missing log files in fluentd logs. Matches in $fluentd_error_summary_file"
-        check_fluentd_missing_logs >> $fluentd_error_summary_file
-        echo >> $fluentd_error_summary_file
-    fi
+    # NOTE(mikal): in_tail only finds new files every refresh_interval (60s
+    #              by default), so retry before believing one is missing.
+    missing_retries=0
+    missing_retries_max=6
+    while check_fluentd_missing_logs >/dev/null; do
+        if [[ $missing_retries -eq $missing_retries_max ]]; then
+            any_critical=1
+            echo "(critical) Found some missing log files in fluentd logs. Matches in $fluentd_error_summary_file"
+            check_fluentd_missing_logs >> $fluentd_error_summary_file
+            echo >> $fluentd_error_summary_file
+            break
+        fi
+        missing_retries=$((missing_retries + 1))
+        echo "Found missing log files in fluentd logs, sleeping 30 seconds"
+        sleep 30
+    done
 fi
 
 if check_docker_log_file_for_sigkill >/dev/null; then
